   ['Turn feedback into practice','Open Practice plan for your summary, improvement priorities, and recommended drills. Return to the review and revisit the moments you want to work on.','The current moment stays below the video. The timestamp navigator and selected note share the Current moment panel below the video. Open All moments to browse the full list and filter by type, author, or text. Moment arrows, the timestamp picker, Follow video, and looping stay together. The selected moment and its conversation share the Moments workspace. The Review details tab contains the practice plan and, for owners, footage and sharing. The Playback tab contains the frame rate. Close a panel to regain screen space; switching panels keeps unfinished text. You can reopen this walkthrough anytime using How to use Replay.']
